%% Title: State · the 11-beat scroll story and explore
%% Summary: The page's story beats in order (scroll progress picks the active beat), the shortcuts into explore, and what explore offers once the reader drives.
%% Sources: public/js/config/story.config.js (STORY, 11 beats), public/js/story.js (onScroll, jump, explore threshold, pulse:* events), public/js/main.js (scrollToExplore), public/js/ui.js (explore chrome, drawers), public/index.html. Spec: TECHNICAL_SPEC.md section 11; PRD section 4.3 (FuN.zip prototype).
stateDiagram-v2
  direction LR

  [*] --> overview : page load, data loaded (live, demo, mixed or none)

  state "0 · overview<br/>intro, REFRESH CYCLE 2–3 MIN" as overview
  state "1 · volume<br/>CHAPTER 01 · VOLUME LEADERS" as volume
  state "2 · divide<br/>CHAPTER 02 · THE DIVIDE" as divide
  state "3 · negativity<br/>CHAPTER 03 · NEGATIVITY HOTSPOTS" as negativity
  state "4 · positivity<br/>CHAPTER 04 · POSITIVITY LEADERS" as positivity
  state "5 · drivers<br/>CHAPTER 05 · WHO’S DRIVING" as drivers
  state "6 · themes-warm<br/>CHAPTER 06 · WHAT RUNS WARM" as themes_warm
  state "7 · themes-cold<br/>CHAPTER 07 · WHAT RUNS COLD" as themes_cold
  state "8 · messengers<br/>CHAPTER 08 · THE MESSENGERS" as messengers
  state "9 · summary<br/>CHAPTER 09 · THE HOUR IN REVIEW" as summary
  state "10 · explore<br/>CHAPTER 10 · YOUR TURN · NEXT STEPS" as explore

  overview --> volume : scroll
  volume --> divide : scroll
  divide --> negativity : scroll
  negativity --> positivity : scroll
  positivity --> drivers : scroll
  drivers --> themes_warm : scroll
  themes_warm --> themes_cold : scroll
  themes_cold --> messengers : scroll
  messengers --> summary : scroll
  summary --> explore : scroll past the explore threshold
  explore --> summary : scroll back up (exploring-changed event, false)

  overview --> explore : Skip to the globe
  note left of overview
    Any beat: a progress rail dot jumps to its beat.
    The SKIP STORY · EXPLORE pill (shown once progress
    passes 0.14, outside explore) jumps to explore.
  end note

  state explore {
    direction TB
    [*] --> free
    free : globe interactive, filter panel, sorted city list, source ribbon
    free --> city : click a city, or a story-card drill chip (drill event)
    city : city detail with its posts
    city --> receipt : why? on a post
    receipt : audit drawer, 4 audiences
    receipt --> city : close
    city --> free : close
    free --> health : header health chip (also on every story beat)
    health : health drawer, alert history, methodology, sources
    health --> free : close
  }

  note right of negativity
    CH03 and CH04 show a featured post whose
    "Why does it say that?" button opens the
    same audit drawer (pulse:trace)
  end note

  classDef done fill:#e8f5e9,stroke:#2e7d32,color:#1b3d1f
  class overview, volume, divide, negativity, positivity, drivers, themes_warm, themes_cold, messengers, summary, explore done
